{"reviewId": "11013967_8bpLKFHzN", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "目前是国内过程充足，但是实体经济萧条。也有在刻意拉动虚拟经济，科创50指数2年时间差不多上升了2倍。但是科技的溢出效应有些，科技新贵的财富更加集中化。同时科技对于生产效率提升的显现还没那么快。所以，路途还很远。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "19159-19235", "abstract": "如果在货币流动性十分充足的情况下，选择放松信贷，可能会出现实体经济与虚拟经济的泡沫性繁荣；如果选择紧缩信贷与财政政策，实体经济很可能陷入通货紧缩与衰退。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "11013967_8bpLKFHzN", "userVid": 11013967, "topics": [], "createTime": 1786922359, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 11013967, "name": "寒之", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epToMeZHMcCicK1geOUmSYNPpLxgXzGmBJEUtL0Zwyhiat4Wicr0NxPDcBrGVRDUTyKoFo6kTdoYbicXw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "寒之", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "阅读，思考，改变", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202407-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 434028127, "name": "lune🍊", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJc12xUiaguLiaG5K9CLQtL1BYmFkXjttagXXtskhJzYUG7Bb8p2cC78qibEsTYpqsBzTOHXcCkdmt5km7U20ZJFLHGeWeQlcvicia8WtDzyLG6Wlw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-C-6-6-4", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComme